/* ---------- POLICY & STATIC PAGE CONTENT (draft copy — review before launch) ---------- */
const DEFAULT_PAGES = {
  about: { title:'The House of VERVE', html:`
    <p class="lead">THE VERVE is not a wardrobe. It is a position.</p>
    <p>We started with a simple conviction: most clothing asks you to blend in. Ours asks you to arrive. Every piece we design — from a 240 GSM oversized tee to a numbered varsity jacket — begins with the same question: does this make the wearer feel unmistakable?</p>
    <h2>NOT MADE TO FOLLOW</h2>
    <p>THE VERVE is an expression of individuality, confidence, and timeless style. We design in muted, architectural palettes — chocolate, ivory, bordeaux, onyx — because presence does not need noise. We cut generously because confidence occupies space. We build heavyweight because substance should be felt, not announced.</p>
    <h2>THE CRAFT</h2>
    <p>Fabrics are specified by weight and hand-feel before silhouette is even sketched. Combed and supima cottons, European flax, brushed-loop fleece — knit and finished to hold structure far beyond the first season. Small runs. Careful screens. Numbered limited editions.</p>
    <h2>DESIGNED FOR INDIA. DRESSED FOR ANYWHERE.</h2>
    <p>We are an Indian label with an international grammar — built for Indian climates, Indian occasions and Indian bodies, presented to the standard of any global fashion house. This is only the beginning of the collection; it is already the standard.</p>
    <p><em>Define Your Presence.</em></p>` },
  contact: { title:'Contact', html:`` },
  faq: { title:'Frequently Asked Questions', html:`` },
  'shipping-policy': { title:'Shipping Policy', html:`
    <p class="lead">Clear, tracked, careful — from our studio to your door.</p>
    <h2>PROCESSING TIME</h2>
    <p>Orders are processed within 1–2 business days (excluding Sundays and public holidays). Orders placed after 4:00 PM IST are counted from the next business day.</p>
    <h2>DELIVERY TIMELINES</h2>
    <ul><li>Metro cities: 2–4 business days</li><li>Other cities and towns: 3–7 business days</li><li>Remote PIN codes: up to 7–9 business days</li></ul>
    <p>Use the PIN code checker on any product page for an indicative delivery estimate for your area.</p>
    <h2>SHIPPING CHARGES</h2>
    <p>Free shipping on all prepaid orders above ₹1,999. Orders below that value carry a flat ₹99 shipping fee. Cash on Delivery orders carry an additional ₹49 handling fee.</p>
    <h2>TRACKING</h2>
    <p>A tracking link is emailed and made available under Account → Orders as soon as your parcel is dispatched. You can also use the Track Order page with your order number.</p>
    <h2>INTERNATIONAL</h2>
    <p>International shipping is being rolled out market by market. Write to us at care@theverve.in with your city and we will confirm availability.</p>` },
  returns: { title:'Returns & Exchanges', html:`
    <p class="lead">7 days to change your mind. No drama.</p>
    <h2>RETURN WINDOW</h2>
    <p>Returns and size exchanges are accepted within 7 days of delivery, for unworn items with tags intact and original packaging. Certain items (innerwear, marked "final sale") are not eligible.</p>
    <h2>HOW IT WORKS</h2>
    <ul><li>Place a request from Account → Orders, or from the Track Order page.</li><li>We arrange a reverse pickup where the courier serves; otherwise we share a drop-off label.</li><li>Once the item passes quality check, your refund is initiated within 48 hours.</li></ul>
    <h2>REFUNDS</h2>
    <p>Prepaid orders are refunded to the original payment method within 5–7 business days of QC approval. COD orders are refunded by UPI or bank transfer to details you provide. Shipping fees (and COD handling) are non-refundable unless the return is due to our error.</p>
    <h2>EXCHANGES</h2>
    <p>Size exchanges ship as soon as the original piece is scanned in transit back to us — subject to stock availability of the requested size.</p>` },
  privacy: { title:'Privacy Policy', html:`
    <p class="lead">Your data is yours. We handle it with the same care as your orders.</p>
    <p>This policy describes what THE VERVE collects, why, and the controls you have. It is a template draft prepared for the demo build and should be reviewed by your legal counsel before going live.</p>
    <h2>WHAT WE COLLECT</h2>
    <ul><li>Account details you provide: name, email, mobile number.</li><li>Delivery addresses you save.</li><li>Order and payment status records. Payment instruments (card/UPI details) are processed by our payment gateway and are never stored on our servers.</li><li>Usage data such as pages viewed, used to improve the store.</li></ul>
    <h2>HOW WE USE IT</h2>
    <p>To fulfil orders, provide support, send transactional updates (order, shipping, refund), prevent fraud, and — only with your consent — send marketing emails you can unsubscribe from at any time.</p>
    <h2>YOUR RIGHTS</h2>
    <p>You can access, correct or delete your account data from Account → Profile, or by writing to care@theverve.in. We retain order records as required by tax and consumer-protection law.</p>
    <h2>SECURITY</h2>
    <p>All traffic is encrypted in transit (TLS). Payments are handled by a PCI-DSS compliant gateway with server-side verification of every transaction.</p>` },
  terms: { title:'Terms & Conditions', html:`
    <p class="lead">The terms that govern your use of this store. Draft — review before launch.</p>
    <h2>USE OF THE STORE</h2>
    <p>By using this website you agree to provide accurate information, to use the store for lawful purchases only, and not to misuse its content, imagery or code.</p>
    <h2>PRICING & TAXES</h2>
    <p>All prices are listed in Indian Rupees and are inclusive of applicable GST. We may correct pricing errors and cancel affected orders with full refund.</p>
    <h2>ORDERS & ACCEPTANCE</h2>
    <p>An order is accepted when payment is verified (or COD is confirmed) and a confirmation email is issued. We may decline or cancel orders where stock, address verification or fraud checks fail, with a full refund where applicable.</p>
    <h2>INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY</h2>
    <p>THE VERVE wordmark, designs, photography and copy are the property of the brand. Reproduction without written permission is prohibited.</p>
    <h2>GOVERNING LAW</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India; courts at the brand's registered city have exclusive jurisdiction.</p>` }
};

/* ---------- FAQ CONTENT ---------- */
const DEFAULT_FAQ = [
  ['What fits do your T-shirts come in?','Our tees are cut in four blocks — Regular, Relaxed, Boxy and Oversized. Every product page lists its block and full measurements in the Size Guide. Oversized styles drop the shoulder and add body volume; size down only if you want a closer fit.'],
  ['How do I choose the right size?','Open the Size Guide on the product page and compare the garment measurements (in inches) with a tee that fits you well today — chest and length are the two that matter most.'],
  ['What is GSM and why does it matter?','GSM is grams per square metre — fabric density. Our essentials sit at 180–220 GSM for breathability, premium tees at 240–260 GSM for structure, and fleece at 380–400 GSM for winter weight. Heavier GSM means more drape and opacity.'],
  ['Do you offer Cash on Delivery?','Yes, COD is available across serviceable PIN codes, with a ₹49 handling fee. Prepaid orders (UPI, cards, net banking, wallets) ship free above ₹1,999.'],
  ['How long does delivery take?','Metros: 2–4 business days. Other cities: 3–7 business days. Every order ships with a tracked link sent to your email and visible under Account → Orders.'],
  ['What is your return policy?','7-day easy returns and size exchanges on unworn pieces with tags intact. Raise the request from Account → Orders and we handle the rest — see the full Returns page.'],
  ['Are Limited Editions restocked?','No. Limited editions are produced in a single numbered run and are never repeated. Sign up for the newsletter to be first into the next drop.'],
  ['How should I care for heavyweight cotton?','Cold wash, inside out, low tumble or line dry, and never iron directly on prints or embroidery. Full instructions are listed on every product page.'],
  ['Can I cancel or change my order?','Yes — while the order is still in "Processing" you can raise a cancellation from Account → Orders. Once it is shipped, use the return flow after delivery.'],
  ['How do I contact support?','Email care@theverve.in or use the Contact page — we reply within one working day, Monday to Saturday.']
];

